WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.955
"Uncle! Come back!" Aladdin screamed.

2
00:00:03.956 --> 00:00:05.929
"Don’t leave me!"

3
00:00:05.930 --> 00:00:10.386
Again and again, Aladdin called out for help.

4
00:00:10.387 --> 00:00:13.956
But of course Magrib did not answer.

5
00:00:13.957 --> 00:00:17.177
The magician had left.

6
00:00:17.178 --> 00:00:21.063
"I’m trapped," Aladdin said, alone and frightened.

7
00:00:21.064 --> 00:00:24.031
"It’s so dark and cold."

8
00:00:24.032 --> 00:00:27.611
But then Aladdin felt a bit of hope.

9
00:00:27.612 --> 00:00:33.115
"I’ll go back to the garden," he thought, "and sit on the grass under a tree.

10
00:00:33.116 --> 00:00:37.921
Maybe then I’ll be able to think of a way to escape."

11
00:00:37.922 --> 00:00:42.528
Aladdin went down the steps and into the golden chamber.

12
00:00:42.529 --> 00:00:44.058
But it had changed.

13
00:00:44.059 --> 00:00:48.055
Now the chamber was filled only with shadows.

14
00:00:48.056 --> 00:00:52.464
He ran to the garden door and stood in front of it.

15
00:00:52.465 --> 00:00:53.953
"My name is Aladdin!

16
00:00:53.954 --> 00:00:57.670
I command you to open!" the boy shouted.

17
00:00:57.671 --> 00:01:00.097
But the door did not move.

18
00:01:00.098 --> 00:01:05.341
Aladdin said the words again. Nothing happened.

19
00:01:05.342 --> 00:01:09.940
"The magic words do not work," said Aladdin.

20
00:01:09.941 --> 00:01:16.630
He walked back through the chamber, climbed back up the steps, and sat down.

21
00:01:16.631 --> 00:01:19.071
"I did everything Uncle told me to do.

22
00:01:19.072 --> 00:01:21.383
I found the lamp and brought it back."

23
00:01:21.384 --> 00:01:24.192
Aladdin shook his head.

24
00:01:24.193 --> 00:01:26.185
"I would have given the lamp to Uncle."

25
00:01:26.186 --> 00:01:31.322
He sighed. "Why didn’t he help me up the last step?"

26
00:01:31.323 --> 00:01:35.019
Aladdin took a glass apple from his pocket.

27
00:01:35.020 --> 00:01:37.445
"I wish I could trade this for a real apple.

28
00:01:37.446 --> 00:01:39.623
I’m so hungry."

29
00:01:39.624 --> 00:01:44.639
Many hours went by, and he couldn’t do anything but think.

30
00:01:44.640 --> 00:01:50.688
"Magrib is not my uncle at all," Aladdin finally decided.

31
00:01:50.689 --> 00:01:53.987
"He is a liar—an evil magician.And

32
00:01:53.988 --> 00:01:56.943
I think he left me here to die." A

33
00:01:56.944 --> 00:02:00.038
tear rolled down the boy’s cheek. When

34
00:02:00.039 --> 00:02:05.268
he raised his hand to wipe it away, he saw the ring on his finger.

35
00:02:05.269 --> 00:02:09.853
He laughed a sad, little laugh.

36
00:02:09.854 --> 00:02:14.532
"My uncle—Magrib put this ring on my finger.

37
00:02:14.533 --> 00:02:17.773
He said it would protect me from danger and fear.

38
00:02:17.774 --> 00:02:20.576
Well, I am in danger right now!

39
00:02:20.577 --> 00:02:22.316
And I am very afraid!

40
00:02:22.317 --> 00:02:24.251
So that was a lie too.

41
00:02:24.252 --> 00:02:27.021
This ring is useless!"

42
00:02:27.022 --> 00:02:33.437
Angry now, Aladdin decided to throw the ring away, but it was tight on his finger.

43
00:02:33.438 --> 00:02:37.101
So he began to pull and twist the ring.

44
00:02:37.102 --> 00:02:43.010
He couldn’t get it off, but a cloud of bright smoke appeared.

45
00:02:43.011 --> 00:02:49.006
Within seconds, the smoke disappeared, and a funny, little man stood there!

46
00:02:49.007 --> 00:02:53.969
He wore wide pants and a cap with tiny bells hanging along the edge.

47
00:02:53.970 --> 00:02:59.297
His skin was the color of dried apricots.

48
00:02:59.298 --> 00:03:03.032
"The genie of the ring has come!" squeaked the fellow.

49
00:03:03.033 --> 00:03:06.139
The bells on his cap jingled.

50
00:03:06.140 --> 00:03:09.256
"The one who wears the ring is my master!

51
00:03:09.257 --> 00:03:11.885
Ask me for anything and I will do it.

52
00:03:11.886 --> 00:03:15.159
I am your slave!"

53
00:03:15.160 --> 00:03:18.573
Aladdin had never seen a genie before.

54
00:03:18.574 --> 00:03:23.318
He thought a genie would be tall and have big muscles.

55
00:03:23.319 --> 00:03:28.372
This genie was smaller than Aladdin, and he was skinny.

56
00:03:28.373 --> 00:03:33.229
Aladdin jumped to his feet, laughing with surprise and joy.

57
00:03:33.230 --> 00:03:34.765
"I can ask for anything?

58
00:03:34.766 --> 00:03:37.277
Then get me out of here!"

59
00:03:37.278 --> 00:03:41.470
"Your wish is my command!" said the genie.

60
00:03:41.471 --> 00:03:47.693
Suddenly the light became so bright that Aladdin had to shut his eyes!

61
00:03:47.694 --> 00:03:53.973
But then slowly he opened one eye, and then he opened the other.

62
00:03:53.974 --> 00:03:57.453
He looked to the left, and he looked to the right.

63
00:03:57.454 --> 00:04:02.752
He opened his eyes wider and looked up into the bright, blue sky.

64
00:04:02.753 --> 00:04:10.243
"I’m free!" he shouted.

